  "details": "# Issue:\nUdon Graph Auto Compiles every time when connecting nodes etc. this is fine for smaller graphs, but can be annoying for bigger / more complex graph systems. There Auto-Compiling can take a significant amount of time which can be disruptive while working on more complex graph systems.\n# Suggestion:\nAdd a Auto-Compiling Setting on the Welcome Screen / Settings drop down. This would still allow creators who work on smaller graph systems to benefit from Auto-Compiling, while allowing creators who work on bigger / more complex systems to not be disrupted by it.",
